<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16273" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσκ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκέω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exercise, practice,
				training,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀσκήσιος ἀγαθοὶ γίνονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					242
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Protag.
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				323d
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνασίων καὶ ἀσκησίων ἐπιμελόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.39
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολεμική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.1.34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					2.478b18
				</span></i>
			: in pl.,<i>exercises,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔθεσικαὶ ἀσκήσεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					518e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Plt.</u>
				294d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. τινος</span>
			<i>practice of</i> or <i>in</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.2.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειλίας ἀλλ᾽ οὐκ ἀνδρείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					791b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> generally,
				<i>mode of life, profession,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; of a philosophical sect, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Κυνικὴ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tox.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of religious
			sects, <i>asceticism,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.61
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				17.1.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.643
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.8.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>adornment,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν τριχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.Socr.
					18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
